    "id": 2002013030270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "12星座とか13星座とか\r\nひとくちに星と言っても色々あったりだとか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自分がイルミネなのもあって、\r\n星占い系はつい気にしてしまうんですよね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "見ている分には興味深いです\r\n本当に学びはじめたら大変そうだなと思いますが",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、灯織は占ったりはしないんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "占いにすべてをゆだねているわけではないので……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私は、占いの結果をお守り代わりにするだけです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030330,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "占ってもらったこともないですし、\r\n占う方もやろうとは思っていないです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030340,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "人の運命とか運勢を決めてしまうのって\r\n恐れ多くて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、手相を占ってもらったことがない\r\n理由ってあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030350,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201303/2002013030350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああいや、答えづらかったらごめん\r\n占いはなんでもやってみるのかなって思っててさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013030360,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "手相はやらない理由……\r\n考えたこともなかったです",
